v 3
d telegram. Send free push notifications (mobile alerts) and exported figures from Stata to Telegram.
d
d Author: Daniel Obst
d Support: email daniel@danielobst.de
d
d telegram provides a no-nonsense way to send real-time status updates,
d free push notifications (mobile alerts), and exported graphs from Stata 
d directly to your smartphone (iPhone or Android) or desktop via the Telegram 
d messenger. It is a hassle-free alternative to wrestling with SMTP email 
d servers or paying for premium third-party apps for remote monitoring of 
d long-running do-files, server batch jobs, or Monte Carlo simulations.
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260403
d
f telegram.ado
f tg.ado
f telegram.sthlp